{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295230","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1029523001:0":{"text":"Fay vividly recounts to Alya the legend of the village, the process of activating the spring, the malt nectar of the Celestial and the dreams.","source_cn":"菲绘声绘色地和阿莉雅讲述了村落的传说，打开泉眼机关的过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4BF750DA21176C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029523002:1":{"text":"Wow! What a worthwhile adventure.","source_cn":"哇！真是一次有价值的探索。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BFDA441DF1F7108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029523003:1":{"text":"I'll do my best to record all of this as a reference for future scholars.","source_cn":"我会努力将这些内容写下，留给其他学者作为参考的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CE6F763BE21F786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1029523003":{"text":"I'll do my best to record all of this as a reference for future scholars.","source_cn":"我会努力将这些内容写下，留给其他学者作为参考的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CE6F763BE21F786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029523004:1":{"text":"Because this was a truly meaningful experience.","source_cn":"因为这是很有意义的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD990C1F5212BE528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029523005:1":{"text":"We may be researching and verifying legends now, but in a hundred or a thousand years, we might become legends ourselves.","source_cn":"虽然现在是在考据与验证传说，但百年，千年以后，我们也有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DFAA53165B812BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029523006:1":{"text":"And I'm even the witness, recorder, and communicator of this legend, which is super exciting.","source_cn":"而我甚至是这一段传说的见证、记录和传颂者，听起来就很让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A949B9E3A1DCBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029523007:1":{"text":"However, some new legends have been circulating recently. They don't seem to have been around for long, unlike those legends that have been passed down for generations.","source_cn":"不过，最近又流传出了一些新的传说，但似乎它们流传的时间...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E5AA6E3C14B65F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029523008:1":{"text":"I'm currently researching these. If you have time, you could help me look into them!","source_cn":"我正在考据这些事。如果您有时间，就拜托多留意了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA0A04F77CE9E93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_reco